.TH QUIPU-GRAPH-CREATE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-graph\-create \- Register a committed named graph
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu graph create\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-timestamp\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIiri\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Register a committed named graph
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-timestamp\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIiri\fR>

